  {
   "k": "162ezpg",
   "en": "Icon frame controls which frame from the resource image strip is used for the resource icon. A 'frame' is the 27 by 27 pixel square the icon occupies in the image."
  },
  {
   "k": "14ok5ex",
   "en": "The resource image strip is defined by the ⟦0⟧ spritetype, which points to ⟦1⟧ by default. By default 1 will refer to the Oil icon, 2 to Aluminium, etc.",
